<!--
    Test dataset for VitalsSectionTest.
    Provides vitals concepts (with CIEL concept mappings), visits, encounters, and obs so
    that tests can call gatherData() without going through saveObs() (which triggers a
    buggy ConceptReferenceRange validator in OpenMRS 2.7.0).

    Concept reference sources (high IDs to avoid conflicts with standardTestDataset):
      concept_source_id=10  CIEL
      concept_source_id=11  TEST (for the custom-mapping override test)

    Concept reference terms (ids 100+) and maps (ids 100+) link concept_ids to CIEL codes.

    Visit 101 — bp scenario: systolic 120 (newer) + older systolic 110 + diastolic 80, plus heart rate 72 and SpO2 98
    Visit 102 — only systolic 120 (blood-pressure partial format test)
    Visit 103 — weight 70 + height 175 (separate vitals test)
    Visit 104 — encounter with no vitals obs (empty-list test)
    Visit 105 — custom concept mapping override (global-property test)
    Visit 106 — no encounters (empty-list test)
-->
